{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nThe English company at the Odeon was a necessary refuge. Pesaroni sings, but tonight the air here demanded something else, and the theatre near my lodgings obliged. The actors were adequate; the scenery, as usual in Paris, a bit of painted cardboard. I paid two francs for a seat that smelled of damp wool.\n\nWe saw Mlle Mars earlier in *Emilia*. She is still formidable, though her voice has thinned. It is interesting to watch how the public swallows her gestures as if they were logical proofs. One sees the spirit of the age in their applause.\n\nI am well. The wine in the Rhineland was better than anything I have found here. Do tell the boys to mind their conduct at the Gymnasium; obedience is the only foundation that holds.\n\nI shall sleep late tomorrow.\n\nYours ever,\nG.W.F. Hegel"}}],"created":1795219146,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":191,"prompt_tokens":1096,"total_tokens":1287,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-7UbgQvzOoL5YHlluFcHVIU8oUoC3tlvZ","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":1096,"prompt_ms":1036.187,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.9454260948905109,"prompt_per_second":1057.7241366664512,"predicted_n":191,"predicted_ms":4530.046,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.842347368421056,"predicted_per_second":41.942178953591196}}